    "Id": "chassisdef_nova_cat_NCT-Z",
    "Name": "Nova Cat",
    "Details": "The Z configuration takes the missile-heavy approach of the Nova Cat E further, mounting four Improved ATM-9 launchers across both arms. Deep ammunition reserves allow the launchers to remain effective across a wide range of engagement distances. Three ER Medium Lasers provide ammunition-independent backup firepower, while a Nova CEWS provides electronic and network support.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Extended Torso Twist</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.13</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Omni</color>",
